🔧 Advanced Improvements
Disable visual effects  
Turn off animations, shadows, and transparency for smoother performance.

Defragment or optimize drives  
HDDs benefit from defragmentation; SSDs should be optimized with built-in tools.

Pause cloud syncing  
Temporarily stop OneDrive/Google Drive sync when gaming or running heavy apps.

Upgrade hardware

Replace HDD with SSD for faster boot and load times.

Add more RAM (16 GB recommended for modern workloads).
